    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051111.0096\n\nBANGKOK, Nov. 11 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nThai bourse down 3.99 points\n\n\n\n\nThe Stock Exchange of Thailand ( SET)index on Friday moved down 3.99 points to close at 690.45 points.\n\nSome 2.29 billion shares worth 11.21 billion Thai baht (about 280.250 million US dollars) changed hands.\n\nSET index lost 2.41 points to close at 694.44 points on Thursday.",
